Cosmological note: the Yin/Yang division of divine labour
阴财神's presence introduces a grammatically important principle. Chinese cosmology systematically mirrors its divine bureaucracy across the Yin/Yang divide — for virtually every major divine function in the Yang realm, there is a corresponding official in the Yin realm:
YANG REALM          YIN REALM
阳财神              阴财神
(Wealth for living) (Wealth for dead)

城隍 (City God)     十殿閻王 (Ten Kings)
(Living world admin) (Underworld admin)

门神 (Door Gods)     大二爷伯
(Living threshold)   (Death threshold)
